{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_07E8E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"从今天起，我要住进那个男人的Mother Base。对我来说，真正的战斗现在才开始。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Zadornov一直为我提供宿舍和奖学金，可如今Zadornov已经被抓了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"既然KGB的资金断了，我也就没法继续上学。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"……那个男人竟然同情这种谎话，还接受了想在Mother Base工作的我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"虽然Miller不知为何极力替我说话，但不管怎么说，那个男人真是愚蠢。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"他手下的士兵也全是一群低能儿。他们似乎以为训练就能获得力量，但那点东西在真正的力量面前等于零。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"更可笑的是，只因为我是十几岁的女学生，他们就一个个对我百般照顾。看来这样反而更方便我行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"刚才侦察居住区时，我看见士兵们聚在甲板一角闹得很热闹。走近一看，原来是在喂猫。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"一群大男人还在那里说“好可爱啊”……到底在干什么。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"虽然觉得可笑，可一旦他们问我意见，我也只能点头。毕竟必须<R=扮演角色,ROLE PLAY>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=扮演角色,ROLE PLAY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":113,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我随口陪他们聊着，其中一个士兵忽然要我给那只猫起名字。听说它刚离开母猫，还没有名字。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"我给那只小猫取名叫“Nuke”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"还装模作样地说什么“关爱生命的心能成为战争的抑制力”——明明我心里根本不是这么想的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我把士兵们给的小鱼放在掌心，小猫便高兴地吃了起来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"多么愚蠢……又多么无力。真让人恶心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""}]}